# Scanned receipt photos (docs/10-AI-ASSISTANT.md §4.2).
#
# User content, not source. The filenames are 128 random bits and the whole point
# of them is that they are unguessable — committing a directory of other people's
# receipts to a repository would defeat that in the most permanent way available.
